# DET-006 Development

Created:

```text
DET-006 — Remote Administrative SMB Logon
```

Objective:

> Detect privileged Windows network authentication associated with remote SMB administrative access between endpoints.

Initial lab detection:

```spl
index=* host="WIN11-02" EventCode=4624 "10.10.10.101" "tadmin"
```

Where a validated `LogonType` field is available:

```spl
index=* host="WIN11-02" EventCode=4624 LogonType=3
| search TargetUserName="tadmin"
```

Portfolio output:

```spl
index=* host="WIN11-02" EventCode=4624 LogonType=3
| search TargetUserName="tadmin"
| eval detection="DET-006 - Remote Administrative SMB Logon"
| table _time detection host TargetUserName IpAddress WorkstationName
```

Field names should be adjusted to match the actual Splunk event schema.

