# Detection Logic

```text
Successful Windows Logon
          |
          v
      Event 4624
          |
          v
     Logon Type 3?
      /       \
     NO       YES
     |         |
     v         v
Ignore    Privileged User?
             /      \
            NO      YES
            |        |
            v        v
         Review    DET-006
                     |
                     v
                Analyst Triage
```

The detection is focused on remote network authentication using a privileged account.

