# False Positive Considerations

Legitimate SMB administrative access can include:

- IT administration
- Helpdesk support
- File administration
- Software deployment
- Backup systems
- Endpoint management
- Remote maintenance
- Security testing

Therefore:

```text
Administrative SMB Access
        !=
Confirmed Lateral Movement
```

Context determines severity.

